  "description": "Relative-path conformance cases shared by every PatchCairn path validator (scripts/pc_paths.py). A case gives either 'path' or 'repeat' ([text, count], optionally with 'prefix' and 'suffix'). 'code' is the categorical refusal code of an invalid case. Non-ASCII characters are escaped so the file reads the same in every language.",
  "limits": {"max_path_units": 200, "max_parts": 64, "max_name_bytes": 255},
